Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.58,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.79,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of\Ndeception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate\Nthe face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,When our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,On your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.87,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.18,0:01:43.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Were they that excited to be\Nin a picture with this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:46.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone looks really happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.98,0:01:50.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, he was the refugees' hero, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.38,0:01:53.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Though it seems he didn't go by "Kuze Hideo" here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:55.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was called "Rou".
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.58,0:01:57.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.59,0:02:11.00,Dialogue,,0,1200,750,,{\i1\b1}Kanji characters such as the words for wolf, \N cheerful and ronin can all be read as "rou".{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:02:00.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At times, he was merciless\Nand vicious like a wolf;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.78,0:02:03.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,at other times, he was as cheerful as a sunny day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:07.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And yet because he also seemed\Nlike a Ronin who might wander off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:09.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and disappear at any moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.58,0:02:11.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he was called "Rou" by the refugees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.88,0:02:39.99,Sign - Copy,,500,0,550,,{\b1}Mother and Child \N of Amity{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.67,0:02:43.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Taiwanese authorities\Nbecame aware of his existence
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,only very recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:50.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Strange rumours started circulating after the\Nrefugees reached an understanding with the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.87,0:02:53.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,local yakuza and began moving out\Nonto the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.17,0:02:56.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,At first, the rumours were about
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.67,0:02:58.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,how the refugees had a leadership figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.37,0:03:00.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But after a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:06.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,as illegal trafficking by refugees and organisational\Nstruggles with the local yakuza became more frequent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.87,0:03:11.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it became necessary to investigate\Nwhether the rumours were true.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:14.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And you confirmed Kuze's presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.87,0:03:19.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Initially, I was just glad that the\Nrefugees weren't stirring up trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.48,0:03:22.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it ended up becoming a big pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.58,0:03:27.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, people who until now\Nwere basically only "boat people"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.28,0:03:31.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,suddenly became highly\Nproficient at doing business
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:34.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and fighting with the yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:38.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If it all happened because of this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.88,0:03:41.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I must say he's quite something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:44.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He also set up the C4 smuggling route?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.38,0:03:46.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.58,0:03:48.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Piracy using modified fishing boats
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:51.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,is the refugees' speciality now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.78,0:03:56.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're doing much better now, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.78,0:03:58.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,simply because Rou left Taiwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I feel sorry for you guys in Public\NSafety for having to deal with him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:04.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did Kuze leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.92,0:04:11.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.32,0:04:13.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,According to the refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.82,0:04:18.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he had to return to Japan for\Nmaintenance on his cybernetic body,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.02,0:04:20.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but who knows if that's really true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:25.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:27.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you, this has been helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.82,0:04:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.82,0:04:32.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, about your return plane ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:35.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sorry, but we were\Nunable to get one for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.22,0:04:36.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So it'll be tomorrow instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:42.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the American Empire-Japan Security Pact was completed just as\Nour relations with China were finally normalised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:47.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,As one might expect, sparks have flown\Nin a number of ugly incidents recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.22,0:04:52.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thanks to that, it's been impossible to\Nmanage international flight schedules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:55.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, you've managed to work out some\Nwell-deserved vacation time for me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.72,0:04:59.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,an overworked government employee?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.22,0:05:01.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go enjoy a day's worth of sightseeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:04.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll do that, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.12,0:05:08.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just don't wander around the\Nrefugee area by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:11.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That place is played out as far\Nas the investigation is concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you want to dig further,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.56,0:05:15.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,try the western part of China.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.46,0:05:19.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rumour has it that there are\Npictures showing the refugees
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.86,0:05:22.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,welcoming Kuze to many of their encampments.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.06,0:05:26.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This hasn't been confirmed, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:29.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,since he's not wanted by\Ninternational authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't understand...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:46.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The hub cyberbrain that appeared\Nin Nagasaki was probably Kuze,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.05,0:05:48.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but a lot of these refugees,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.65,0:05:51.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,particularly the elderly and\Nchildren, don't have cyberbrains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.15,0:05:56.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How did he make them\Nsynchronise with his thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:01.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let me work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.16,0:06:03.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is a deal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They are ruthless, even towards children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.66,0:06:17.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You don't call returning what\Nyou stole from someone a "trade"!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:20.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Spill it. Where's my stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.26,0:06:23.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where are the goods?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.56,0:06:28.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You damn brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.15,0:06:45.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.92,0:07:08.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.02,0:07:12.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:14.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm your responsibility now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.32,0:07:16.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}I'm{\i} responsible for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.42,0:07:16.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:19.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're called Xiaojie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're famous around here\Nas an upstart yakuza clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.02,0:07:23.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:24.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Now that you've pissed them off,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.02,0:07:27.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,they'll come back to do even worse\Nthings to me to make me pay, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.22,0:07:29.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even if I wasn't the one who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:33.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Would it have been better if I hadn't\Ninterrupted and you got your arm cut off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In a way, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:36.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then why don't you go apologise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Next time, it may not be just your arm, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. Policeman!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:49.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Mr. P...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:50.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.15,0:07:58.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:03.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is the thanks I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:06.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Lady, you wouldn't happen to\Nbe a full cyborg, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:08.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.55,0:08:11.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen someone this high quality before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.75,0:08:12.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where'd you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.65,0:08:14.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:18.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm planning on becoming a full\Ncyborg, just like Rou,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.65,0:08:21.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so losing an arm isn't really a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.95,0:08:22.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:24.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You know Rou?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,{\i1}I'm{\i} asking {\i1}you{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:26.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.25,0:08:27.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.55,0:08:32.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, I'm your responsibility now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:33.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.25,0:08:36.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:37.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:47.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.78,0:09:08.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.68,0:09:09.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.48,0:09:13.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These are Red Data EX series green turtles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.48,0:09:15.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And these are EW series ostriches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.98,0:09:17.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well made, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.58,0:09:20.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They just need to be painted and shipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.48,0:09:24.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's the real one they used to\Nmanufacture before the Great War.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.78,0:09:27.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Compared to that, the paint is rougher
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:30.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the finer details are lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But they're stamped and have a model number,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.38,0:09:35.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so they are basically indistinguishable\Nfrom the real one, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.48,0:09:39.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:40.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Get what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.08,0:09:43.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These are all made of cocaine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.55,0:09:50.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're made by pressure shaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.75,0:09:53.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The method was used in the past\Nin Mexico sometime I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:58.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,because it wouldn't be all that strange for\Nadults to be carrying these kinds of figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:09:59.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you come up with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:01.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou did.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.15,0:10:04.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's the first time we're doing this, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:08.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did you intend to force my complicity
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.45,0:10:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,by showing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.95,0:10:13.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.25,0:10:17.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Lady, you're no Xiaojie or Huanglong member.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.35,0:10:22.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But you're not a refugee or a tourist either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.45,0:10:23.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.75,0:10:26.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want to get a cybernetic body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:33.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought you might know a\Nway to get one illegally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.15,0:10:36.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why do you want a cybernetic body?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.15,0:10:38.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm going to carry on what Rou tried to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.55,0:10:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.05,0:10:42.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.85,0:10:44.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.32,0:10:45.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.32,0:10:47.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll just hide somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:49.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You guys disappear for a while, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.52,0:10:52.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This place will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.82,0:10:54.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're stupid,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so they'll never realise what these things are.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.82,0:11:06.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Xiaojie have found this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.62,0:11:07.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.18,0:11:41.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's a lot more respectable\Nthan I thought it'd be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:41.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.98,0:11:43.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why'd we come to a place like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.08,0:11:45.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go to my hideout.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.78,0:11:48.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You'll be a lot safer here\Nthan at a place like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.08,0:11:51.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A suite on the top floor, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.68,0:11:55.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A suite?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:01.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One moment, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.28,0:12:08.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A platinum card...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.78,0:12:10.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who are you, lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:15.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:17.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:18.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:24.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In our household,\NI don't let him call me "Mother".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.30,0:12:26.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,My mom's young, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:40.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}Following the renewal of\Nthe AE-Japan Security Pact,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:44.30,Dialogue,,1450,0,850,,{\i1\b1}Tientai Broadcasting Station{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.07,0:12:44.30,Dialogue,,1525,0,175,,{\i1\b1}Host{\i0\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:43.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}the issue of US troop deployment became the main topic.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.70,0:12:44.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}Japan's response will...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:48.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}Ostriches are now only bred as meat,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:52.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}but until the beginning of this century,\Nthey ran free across the savannah.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.60,0:12:54.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}They had a unique child raising method,{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.60,0:12:58.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}in which the strongest female in\Nthe flock would take all the young{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:02.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}and cluster them around her own chick{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.00,0:13:00.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you intend to do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:05.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,900,,{\i1}to protect it from predators,\Nthereby propagating the survival of the fittest...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll tell you now since I don't\Nwant you to get your hopes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:10.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm leaving here tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:10.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't want to be harsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.55,0:13:21.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I suggest that you explain your situation\Nto the police as soon as possible,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.95,0:13:23.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and get their protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:27.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Who's going to protect a refugee kid, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:29.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Refugees don't have anywhere to go to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.95,0:13:32.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,anywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.15,0:13:35.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're the ostriches that\Nfeed you bourgeois people!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.82,0:13:38.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Kuze...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.41,0:13:40.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou told you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.97,0:13:42.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.37,0:13:46.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What kind of person was he to the refugees?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.87,0:13:48.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He was everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.17,0:13:49.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A hero and a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.97,0:13:51.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did he suggest becoming a cyborg to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:52.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.87,0:13:55.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But to do the same things Rou did,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have to become a cyborg too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.17,0:13:59.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're young.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:03.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou said that since he'd\Nalready died once long ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.97,0:14:08.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he should use the remnants of his "ghost"\Nfor the ones who came to know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.97,0:14:14.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Those words gave me hope when\NI'd given up on everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.57,0:14:19.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I felt that I wanted to be like\Nhim, even if I became just a copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:21.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You don't seem to have a cyberbrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.07,0:14:24.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How did you synchronise with his thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.57,0:14:25.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.47,0:14:26.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.77,0:14:28.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You just have to talk to Rou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.57,0:14:32.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Everyone likes Rou, just from talking to him once.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.17,0:14:34.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Talk...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.37,0:14:37.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What a strange man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:42.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When I first saw you, I thought you were like Rou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.47,0:14:43.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's why I invited you with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.17,0:14:45.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But it's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.87,0:14:47.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll do it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou always fought alone, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:52.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.77,0:14:54.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I won't stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.37,0:14:55.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:18.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:20.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.64,0:15:21.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Can complete cyborgs...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.94,0:15:26.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,have sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.74,0:15:34.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Want to try it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.74,0:15:36.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:53.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,ID card...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is my car here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.36,0:16:34.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.66,0:16:35.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:43.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The airport, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:55.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That kid actually had some backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.62,0:16:58.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I got some idea of what Kuze was like, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:17:02.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In any case, what is the real\Nreason they are attracted to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:04.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is this another Stand Alone Complex phenomenon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.52,0:17:09.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Will I make my flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:11.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You have plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.54,Sign,,0,750,750,,{\fs35}{\b1\i1}Longchuan Hot Springs{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:18.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:24.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.89,0:17:26.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He's still just a spoiled kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, could you go here, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.37,0:17:34.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I suddenly remembered that\NI have unfinished business.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.27,0:17:34.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.47,0:17:37.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The deal won't be easy this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:39.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,so I'll go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.77,0:17:42.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if I don't come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.57,0:17:44.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I ask that one of you carry on with the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.07,0:17:46.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just like Rou taught us,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.17,0:17:47.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,let's not die meaningless deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.47,0:17:48.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:48.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You be careful, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:51.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:58.18,Dialogue,,350,0,550,,{\b1\i1}Longchuan \N \N  Hot \N \N Springs{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.10,0:18:06.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll be taking a look around, if you don't mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.92,0:18:32.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,To think that I still could\Nfeel an emotion like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.03,0:18:47.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I brought him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.31,0:18:56.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're Chai?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:58.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.81,0:19:02.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you for taking my rude\Nrequest into consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.41,0:19:05.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh? You know your manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:08.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is my first time meeting you, after all,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.61,0:19:12.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,not to mention that we will be partners\Nin trying to make a business succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.51,0:19:16.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We haven't decided on that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.81,0:19:18.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But you are an interesting fellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.41,0:19:19.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you think, Boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.31,0:19:22.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If the circumstances were different,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.71,0:19:25.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,we might have been able to become partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:27.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't you agree, Xiaojie
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:29.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure you're joking, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:36.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We had no intention of wrangling\Nwith the Huanglong over this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.31,0:19:38.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bad luck, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:40.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll kill you first,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:42.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,then kill all of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:45.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll look for the goods later.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.82,0:20:00.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't remember calling for any women.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:04.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I don't remember being called, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.01,0:20:09.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.85,0:20:15.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry for bothering you, Boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.45,0:20:18.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We can't pollute this place with refugee blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.35,0:20:20.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll repay you another time in some form...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.15,0:20:28.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.85,0:20:30.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.29,0:20:34.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You're the woman from yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.79,0:20:40.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'd like to trade this for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:44.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't retaliate on the refugees, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.29,0:20:46.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Those are my demands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:49.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you accept them, I'll go away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:51.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If that's not possible, I'll have to use force.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.29,0:20:53.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.89,0:20:58.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have a short temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:13.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you of the same "kind" as Rou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.53,0:21:15.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm whatever you think you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:22.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.68,0:21:23.48,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.17,0:21:33.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.57,0:21:34.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You'll all be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:42.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:48.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"If you know thyself and know thy enemy,\Nyou will win a hundred battles without fail."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.77,0:21:50.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This deal is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.94,0:22:10.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Rou didn't tell you to become a cyborg
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:15.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,or tell you to engage in a dangerous struggle\Nthat would cost you your life, did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:20.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You have courage and talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.94,0:22:22.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But if you die, you'll have nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.09,0:22:26.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,For now, put away what you were\Ntaught and make your own future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.79,0:22:28.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.56,0:23:10.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.46,0:23:14.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:17.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:21.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.16,0:23:25.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:28.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:32.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.76,0:23:36.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.59,0:23:38.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:39.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.53,0:23:43.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.13,0:23:46.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.16,0:23:47.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.56,0:23:48.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.11,0:23:51.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.10,0:23:49.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.58,0:23:53.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.20,0:23:54.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.46,0:23:57.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:58.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.89,0:23:59.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.87,0:24:01.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:03.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.37,0:24:03.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.15,0:24:08.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.46,0:24:07.67,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.43,0:24:12.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.65,0:24:10.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:13.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.97,0:24:15.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.27,0:24:16.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:16.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.52,0:24:19.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:22.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.67,0:24:25.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
